{"code": 1, "data": {"content": "<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: right;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 14px;\">[收录于&nbsp; <strong><em><a style=\"color: #000000;\" href=\"/news/2396/content00795?type=0\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">#链产品&nbsp;</span></a></em></strong> 合集]</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 14px;\">十余年来，京东物流通过一体化供应链物流解决方案，在数字化世界里沉淀技术和算法，为客户供应链变革提供针对性解决方案,并基于高效运营的物流网络，将数字化世界里的方案落地至物理世界。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff; background-color: #d56f27; font-size: 20px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑;\">&nbsp;消费品行业物流解决方案&nbsp;</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">以消费者为中心，发挥京东物流仓、运、配网络优势及数智化服务能力，面向客户提供&ldquo;顶层设计+数字化技术+全场景履约&rdquo;集成的一体化供应链物流解决方案，支持品牌供应链数智化渠道变革落地，在提升供应链响应效率的同时降低供应链管理难度及履约成本。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/217132/30/21061/121586/632175eaEd01eddaf/60b3169e79b52969.jpg\" /></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/47985/38/20823/67528/632175f4E6b7084f7/4bd85abea534e217.jpg\" /></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/204118/16/26614/124215/63217600E2eb974e4/12691ca421a8b3ed.jpg\" /></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; color: #ffffff; background-color: #5e23c7;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑;\">&nbsp;服饰行业物流解决方案&nbsp;</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">京东物流秉承客户为先的准则，利用覆盖全国的仓、运、配网络物流，为客户提供最优质的基础物流服务。同时通过大数据驱动、科技赋能、智能预测补调、仓网规划、质量控制塔以及自动化设备的应用，助力企业数字化转型，与客户共同打造柔性、智能、敏捷供应链。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/203877/5/26199/97721/6321763fEa1780441/08965a1c57baa1b6.jpg\" /></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/196185/29/28414/72039/6321764aE2cfcc161/480b69f494db704d.jpg\" /></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/178425/16/28982/133817/63217651E2a6321f3/43bf62395a828bc7.jpg\" /></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff; font-size: 20px; background-color: #236fa1;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑;\">&nbsp;汽车行业物流解决方案&nbsp;</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">以客户为中心，充分发挥京东物流大数据、智能预测等数字化服务能力，为汽车行业客户提供自动化、数字化、智能化的一体供应链物流解决方案，助力汽车行业客户供应链自动化、数字化转型，共同建设一体化供应链的精益物流。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/108061/9/32877/94486/63217681Ea2dbbbdc/c24ca17d70b2589d.jpg\" /></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/135615/25/24010/59996/63217687Ea7396302/a8d0e884edb81d85.jpg\" /></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/190238/10/28446/99465/6321768eE53f4ad37/2d34ac1b69b9a249.jpg\" /></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; color: #ffffff; background-color: #4ca7f3;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑;\">&nbsp;3C行业物流解决方案&nbsp;</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">京东物流凭借数智化、一体化供应链物流的能力，提供迅速、便捷、优质、安全的服务，满足3C企业供应链不同环节的需求。通过多渠道一盘货的一站式物流解决方案，助力企业优化库存，实现降本增效的目标。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/156249/15/30147/104201/6321770eEa29e45c9/476e777d3698ba73.jpg\" /></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/94523/7/32455/70891/63217714Ef4ea3336/e8442a12d19e09a6.jpg\" /></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/75488/33/18299/116167/6321771cE7fb72160/a5cfaeec45426dcb.jpg\" /></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; color: #ffffff; background-color: #22c3c4;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑;\">&nbsp;家电行业物流解决方案&nbsp;</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">京东物流根据家电企业的发展现况，从生产环节、成品流通环节、售后环节，以供应链物流的精益运营为基础，通过自动化、数智化赋能，提升生产效率，优化供应链布局，最终实现产销协同的一体化供应链物流目标。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/211708/20/21403/86826/63217768E064f6967/6444657a3858c5a6.jpg\" /></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/195952/15/28892/67146/63217771E69fc70be/c6fad46137c000db.jpg\" /></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/9625/24/19541/93307/63217777E97351b4a/8b20c34b4eb22c62.jpg\" /></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff; font-size: 20px; background-color: #d56f27;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑;\">&nbsp;大家居行业物流解决方案&nbsp;</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">京东物流专注解决家居行业全链需求，整合优质资源，通过京东线上标准化服务平台，依托大件专业自营送装体系，提供集仓储、物流、配送、安装一体化解决方案，辅助维修、拆旧、跟踪及评价等全面服务，通过数据化、可视化、标准化的服务体系，不断刷新行业水平和质量，优化终端消费者的使用体验，为商家提供除供应链管理外的增值需求，提升商家的品牌溢价。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/51678/2/21875/74186/6321779cE18dfaf9a/ea9e2ed9ce009187.jpg\" /></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/187049/30/28738/59844/632177a3E69894bb8/5b46d189eb5f9ce6.jpg\" /></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/106272/27/31273/80168/632177aaE1088e6d8/e939b14f73207555.jpg\" /></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">京东物流基于过去十余年构建的扎实的物流基础设施、技术应用和商业洞察能力，通过链接、赋能、共享，能更多地实现社会化资源的充分利用，&ldquo;以实助实&rdquo;，让一体化供应链物流服务助力企业、行业高质量发展。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://getwuce.jdl.com/#/diyForm?formCode=BD3187402377390195328&amp;channelL1Code=l1-ch8&amp;channelCode=wucech87219\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/45911/39/21563/43354/6322f099E97645702/ce89346243d95c46.png\" /></a></p>", "contentAbstract": "", "contentCode": "content00801", "contentTitle": "从一体化供应链物流解决方案识京东物流实力", "contentType": 2, "createTime": 1663137100000, "id": 2407, "isDelete": 0, "link": "", "linkType": 0, "projectName": "京东物流官网", "srcUrl": "/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/52317/40/21842/61539/6321933aE42ee9dfe/17687ae7a5a0db8f.jpg", "updateTime": 1677148520000}}